  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Feet_items\" title=\"Category:Feet items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Feet.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Boots_of_Anchoring\">Boots of Anchoring</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #DDAAFF solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#DDA0DD;--bg-color-1-dark:#773777;--bg-color-2:#EEDDFF;--bg-color-2-dark:#3A2F45;--header-color:#DDA0DD;--header-color-dark:#773777;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\">18\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Boots_Generic_Dark.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Boots_Generic_Dark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Clothing / Boots\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Feet\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">110\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a>:</b> <b>Leather</b> armor is made of the hide of animals. It provides decent protection without excessively restricting the user's movements.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF; width: 150px;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; width: 450px;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0006405000</span>6,405<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Crafted\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Crafted\">Crafted</a></b>, Crafted in <a href=\"/page/Amrath\" title=\"Amrath\">Amrath</a> by <a href=\"/page/Liella_d%27Orien\" title=\"Liella d&#39;Orien\">Liella d'Orien</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Anchoring\" title=\"Anchoring\">Anchoring</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Anchoring\" title=\"Anchoring\">Anchoring</a>:</b> This item grants its wearer immunity to effects that are time based or involve planar displacement.</span></span>\n<ul><li>Immunity to <a href=\"/page/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a></li>\n<li>Immunity to <a href=\"/page/Banishment\" title=\"Banishment\">Banishment</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Boots_of_Anchoring.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Boots_of_Anchoring.png/420px-Boots_of_Anchoring.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"256\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Boots_of_Anchoring.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Crafted by Liella d'Orien, these boots ward against time and planar displacement effects.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Liella_d%27Orien\" title=\"Liella d&#39;Orien\">Liella d'Orien</a> will craft these boots from four items collected from Devil-related quests. The Boots have no other stats other than Anchoring, which makes you immune to <a href=\"/page/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a> and <a href=\"/page/Banishment\" title=\"Banishment\">Banishment</a>. This item is used to prevent yourself from getting banished at the <a href=\"/page/Horoth\" title=\"Horoth\">Horoth</a> end fight in the <a href=\"/page/Tower_of_Despair\" title=\"Tower of Despair\">Tower of Despair</a> raid (which sends you back to Stormreach).  \n</p>\n<ul><li>This is the only quest where this effect can occur, so the only quest where these boots are useful.</li>\n<li>Immunity to <a href=\"/page/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a> can be bypassed by taking them off, getting buffs then putting them back on - the boots don't dispel any buffs that you already have.</li>\n<li>Crafting the Boots can be a long and bothersome process - <a href=\"/page/Item:The_Banhammer\" title=\"Item:The Banhammer\">The Banhammer</a> can be used as a more convenient replacement, and backline characters <i>may</i> be able to get away with a high-charge <a href=\"/page/Spell_Absorption\" title=\"Spell Absorption\">Spell Absorption</a> item (melee DPS characters and the tank should <i>not</i> rely on this.)</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Boot_Ingredients\">Boot Ingredients</span></h2>\n<p>You can find these ingredients from <a href=\"/page/Devil_Battlefield\" title=\"Devil Battlefield\">Amrath quests</a>, <a href=\"/page/Devil_Assault_(quest)\" title=\"Devil Assault (quest)\">Devil Assault</a>, and <a href=\"/page/The_Shroud\" title=\"The Shroud\">The Shroud</a>; or, as they are <a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Unbound</a>, in the <a href=\"/page/Auction_House\" title=\"Auction House\">Auction House</a> (although they are very rarely sold these days.) You need only 1 of each.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" width=\"99%&#39; align=\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\"></th>\n<th><a href=\"/page/A_New_Invasion\" title=\"A New Invasion\">A New Invasion</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"/page/Bastion_of_Power\" title=\"Bastion of Power\">Bastion of Power</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"/page/Genesis_Point\" title=\"Genesis Point\">Genesis Point</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"/page/Sins_of_Attrition\" title=\"Sins of Attrition\">Sins of Attrition</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"/page/The_Weapons_Shipment\" title=\"The Weapons Shipment\">The Weapons Shipment</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"/page/Wrath_of_the_Flame\" title=\"Wrath of the Flame\">Wrath of the Flame</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"/page/Devil_Assault_(quest)\" title=\"Devil Assault (quest)\">Devil Assault</a></th>\n<th><a href=\"/page/The_Shroud\" title=\"The Shroud\">The Shroud</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><small>3rd Floor Locked Chest <br />End Chest</small></td>\n<td><small>End Chest</small></td>\n<td><small>Any End Chest</small></td>\n<td><small>Any End Chest</small></td>\n<td><small>Any End Chest<br />(not from optional)</small></td>\n<td><small>End Chest</small></td>\n<td><small>End Chest<br />(elite/epic only)</small></td>\n<td><small>NPC Reward\n</small></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Demon%27s_Blood\" title=\"It&#39;s a useful adhesive, but don&#39;t drink it without preforming the right ritual first...\"><img alt=\"It&#39;s a useful adhesive, but don&#39;t drink it without preforming the right ritual first...\" src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Demon%27s_Blood_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span><br /><b><a href=\"/page/Demon%27s_Blood\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Demon&#39;s Blood\">Demon's Blood</a></b></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>very rare</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Devil%27s_Keepsake\" title=\"This item held some personal attachment to a powerful denizen of this plane! Perhaps it can help you stay attached to your location.\"><img alt=\"This item held some personal attachment to a powerful denizen of this plane! Perhaps it can help you stay attached to your location.\" src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Devil%27s_Keepsake_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span><br /><b><a href=\"/page/Devil%27s_Keepsake\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Devil&#39;s Keepsake\">Devil's Keepsake</a></b></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Mysterious_Artifact\" title=\"Artifact of those who came before. No one knows who they were, or cares, because all they seemed to be good at was making pottery and dingy stone ruins.\"><img alt=\"Artifact of those who came before. No one knows who they were, or cares, because all they seemed to be good at was making pottery and dingy stone ruins.\" src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Mysterious_Artifact_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span><br /><b><a href=\"/page/Mysterious_Artifact\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mysterious Artifact\">Mysterious Artifact</a></b></td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>very rare</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Pure_Shavarath_Iron\" title=\"It&#39;s like iron, just more heavy, more cold, and more dull.\"><img alt=\"It&#39;s like iron, just more heavy, more cold, and more dull.\" src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Pure_Shavarath_Iron_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span><br /><b><a href=\"/page/Pure_Shavarath_Iron\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pure Shavarath Iron\">Pure Shavarath Iron</a></b></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>yes\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Once you have all 4 items, bring them to the Planar Travel NPC <a href=\"/page/Liella_d%27Orien\" title=\"Liella d&#39;Orien\">Liella d'Orien</a>, who will send you out of Amrath. Select the bottom option to ask about the Boots of Anchoring, then give her the ingredients and she will make you a set. Be sure the 4 ingredients are in your main backpack, not your ingredients bag or Shared Crafting Storage.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201314\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.128 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2662/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4670/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n137.99%  142.650     41 Template:IO\n100.00%  103.375      1 -total\n 98.08%  101.392      1 Template:Named_item\n 92.78%   95.912      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 49.29%   50.952      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 47.47%   49.077      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 45.58%   47.119      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 43.15%   44.608      2 Template:InCategory\n 20.07%   20.744      1 Template:Mat\n 19.22%   19.872      3 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:9462-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817201314 and revision id 652023. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Clothing\n  | name                     = Boots of Anchoring\n  | type                     = Boots\n  | class                    = Clothing\n  | basevalue                = 6,405pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | slot                     = Feet\n  | durability               = 110\n  | material                 = Leather\n  | hardness                 = 15\n  | minlevel                 = 18\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoA}}\n  | quest                    = Crafted\n  | chest                    = Crafted in [[Amrath]] by [[Liella d'Orien]]\n  | end reward               = \n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Anchoring}}\n** Immunity to [[Haste]]\n** Immunity to [[Banishment]]\n  | crafting                 = \n  | description              = Crafted by Liella d'Orien, these boots ward against time and planar displacement effects.\n  | pic                      = Boots Generic Dark.png\n  | picdesc                  = Boots of Anchoring.png\n  | tips                     = \n[[Liella d'Orien]] will craft these boots from four items collected from Devil-related quests. The Boots have no other stats other than Anchoring, which makes you immune to [[Haste]] and [[Banishment]]. This item is used to prevent yourself from getting banished at the [[Horoth]] end fight in the [[Tower of Despair]] raid (which sends you back to Stormreach).  \n* This is the only quest where this effect can occur, so the only quest where these boots are useful.\n* Immunity to [[Haste]] can be bypassed by taking them off, getting buffs then putting them back on - the boots don't dispel any buffs that you already have.\n* Crafting the Boots can be a long and bothersome process - {{Item|The Banhammer}} can be used as a more convenient replacement, and backline characters ''may'' be able to get away with a high-charge [[Spell Absorption]] item (melee DPS characters and the tank should ''not'' rely on this.)\n}}\n[[Category:Quest items]][[Category:Crafted loot]]\n\n==Boot Ingredients== \nYou can find these ingredients from [[Devil Battlefield|Amrath quests]], [[Devil Assault (quest)|Devil Assault]], and [[The Shroud]]; or, as they are {{Bind|No}}, in the [[Auction House]] (although they are very rarely sold these days.) You need only 1 of each.\n\n{|class=\"wikitable\" width=\"99%' align=\"center\"\n!rowspan=\"2\"| ||[[A New Invasion]]||[[Bastion of Power]]||[[Genesis Point]]||[[Sins of Attrition]]||[[The Weapons Shipment]]||[[Wrath of the Flame]]||[[Devil Assault (quest)|Devil Assault]]||[[The Shroud]]\n|-\n|<small>3rd Floor Locked Chest <br />End Chest||<small>End Chest||<small>Any End Chest||<small>Any End Chest||<small>Any End Chest<br />(not from optional)||<small>End Chest||<small>End Chest<br />(elite/epic only)||<small>NPC Reward\n|-\n| [[File:Demon's Blood_icon.png | link= Demon's Blood | It's a useful adhesive, but don't drink it without preforming the right ritual first...]]<br />'''[[Demon's Blood]]'''||-||yes||-||-||very rare||yes||yes||yes\n|-\n| [[File:Devil's_Keepsake_icon.png | link= Devil's Keepsake | This item held some personal attachment to a powerful denizen of this plane! Perhaps it can help you stay attached to your location. ]]<br />'''[[Devil's Keepsake]]'''||-||-||-||yes||yes||-||yes||yes\n|-\n| [[File:Mysterious_Artifact_icon.png | link= Mysterious Artifact | Artifact of those who came before. No one knows who they were, or cares, because all they seemed to be good at was making pottery and dingy stone ruins.]]<br />'''[[Mysterious Artifact]]'''||yes||-||-||-||very rare||yes||yes||yes\n|-\n| [[File:Pure_Shavarath_Iron_icon.png | link= Pure Shavarath Iron | It's like iron, just more heavy, more cold, and more dull.]]<br />'''[[Pure Shavarath Iron]]'''||-||-||yes||-||yes||-||yes||yes\n|}\n\nOnce you have all 4 items, bring them to the Planar Travel NPC [[Liella d'Orien]], who will send you out of Amrath. Select the bottom option to ask about the Boots of Anchoring, then give her the ingredients and she will make you a set. Be sure the 4 ingredients are in your main backpack, not your ingredients bag or Shared Crafting Storage.",
